[size=6][b]𖤝 ReAnimation - first-person - v3: Complete[/b][/size]

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/MaxYari/OpenMWReAnimation/main/imgs/preview.png[/img]

An immersive reimagining of the TES3: Morrowind 1st-person animations. Punch, slash, chop, shoot and [i]thrust[/i] your way through vvardenfell with style!

Absolute most animations are remade from scratch and many more animations are added to break up the repetative attack animation spam. Furthermore some weapon subtypes received few additional unique animations (shortblades and katanas).

Overall twice as much animation juice as the original game.

Does not include spellcasting animations.

Developed for OpenMW engine. [b]Requires OpenMW 0.51+[/b].

